1
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:13,240
Send Message writes to the client from the dealing desk.

2
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:17,680
Opened from an account, it goes to that account.

3
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:28,210
You can also send to every client, to everyone online, or to one login. Take care: All and Online reach every trader.

4
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:33,340
Type the message and Send.

5
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:37,340
Message at the top right opens the same window, for a message to more clients.

